sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SIM as Telemetry Simulator
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server
    participant DB as Django ORM and Database
    participant ML as ML Anomaly Engine
    participant AGT as LangGraph Agent
    participant MCP as FastMCP Server
    participant CHAIN as TuniSovereignLedger

    SIM->>GRPC: StreamTelemetry(node, metric, value, timestamp)
    GRPC->>DB: create TelemetryReading (protocol gRPC)
    GRPC->>ML: score latest readings of the node
    ML->>DB: read recent readings (indexed by node, metric, timestamp)

    alt Anomaly detected
        ML->>DB: create AnomalyAndForecastEvent
        ML->>AGT: trigger run (ANOMALY_ALERT)
        AGT->>DB: create AgentLoopExecution (empty recommendation, confidence 0)
        AGT->>MCP: call tool to read quota of the cooperative
        MCP->>DB: read CooperativeUnit and ResourceNodePlot
        DB-->>MCP: daily_quota_limit and allocated share
        MCP-->>AGT: approved units proposal
        loop Policy self-correction until proposal is within quota
            AGT->>AGT: check proposal against max quota
        end
        AGT->>CHAIN: anchor salted commitment (Web3.py)
        CHAIN-->>AGT: tx_hash and block_number
        AGT->>DB: create OnChainZKReceipt (one per execution)
        AGT->>DB: update final_recommendation and confidence_score
    else Normal reading
        ML-->>GRPC: no event
    end

    GRPC-->>SIM: acknowledgement
